  "details": "Its about time there was SOMETHING done about cloth. Unity cloth is just not really cutting it in 2025. I know you guys hate whitelisting third party assets but my guys, gotta do something here. theres tons of content avenues which are limited by the lack of good cloth physics. Youve occasionally argued not enough people use cloth to justify any priority. But its a catch 22. there is little use because its so limited and not-good, which means less people use it, which creates less demand.\n\nMeanwhile, theres several third party alternatives that are not only better, but probably have better performance at that. which tackles another gripe you have with cloth.\n\nI know furries have not as much use for it unlike dynamic bones, so there isnt as much of a rush to get out a replacement on that front, but cmon, toss us cloth enjoyers a bone, guys?",
